29. Check a Checkpoint

Needs the Supabase keys (step 25). It downloads every PC's part and checks it.

RUN

python scripts\checkpoints.py verify live --run ored_v3 --config configs\char_transformer.yaml

python scripts\checkpoints.py verify best --run ored_v3 --config configs\char_transformer.yaml

OUTPUT

VERIFIED

or:

FAILED
  - rank 1: object ored_v3/live/checkpoint_.../__1_0.distcp is missing

Checking a folder on one PC only works if that PC has every part:

python scripts\distributed.py verify checkpoints\ored_v3\live\checkpoint_epoch_0040_... --config configs\char_transformer.yaml

