31. See It on Your Phone (Supabase)

Supabase → SQL Editor:

select * from ored_training_run_overview;

Shows: run, how many PCs, PCs alive, live epoch, best epoch, best loss.

select rank, hostname, gpu_name, status, health from ored_training_worker_status order by rank;

Shows each PC:

rank 0  RTX 5060  training   alive
rank 1  RTX 3060  training   alive
rank 2  RTX 4050  checkpointing   alive

"no heartbeat (unknown)" = PC not heard from for a while. It may be busy or off. Check it.

select role, epoch, val_loss, world_size, is_complete, is_current from ored_checkpoint_groups where run_name = 'ored_v3';

Shows live / best / history and if all PCs saved their part.

